<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 7.2 POINTS TO 717.4 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 7.2 POINTS TO 717.4 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 7.2 points on Thursday to 717.4 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the transport index rising the most, up 16.1 points to 1,101.5.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
